DTSTART:20261119T020000Z
DTEND:20261119T040000Z
SUMMARY:Planning Commission Meeting (City of Duvall)
LOCATION:The November 2026 Planning Commission meetings will be held on the 1st and 3rd Wednesdays of the month because the first meeting fell on a federal holiday and was canceled. The Planning Commission will resume its regular schedule for December. The Planning Commission meets on the second and fourth Wednesdays of each month. Meetings begin at 6:00 P.M. at the Duvall Visitor Center\, 15619 Main St NE\, Duvall\, WA 98019. Refer to the City&apos\;s Agenda Center for meeting agendas. A Zoom link for virtual attendance is provided in the meeting agenda. Meeting recordings are available the day after the meeting. You can watch this and previous meetings on our YouTube channel . For more information about meetings\, please visit our website . - 15619 Main Street\, NE Duvall WA 98019
URL:/common/modules/iCalendar/iCalendar.aspx?feed=calendar&catID=32
END:VEVENT
