SUMMARY:Cowlitz County Noxious Weed Control Board Meetings (Cowlitz County)
LOCATION:The Cowlitz County Noxious Weed Control Board will meet on the 2nd Wednesday of each month in 2026\, except there will be no meeting in March\, July\, and November.&nbsp\; The meetings will be held at 6:00 PM in the first-floor conference room at the WSU Extension Office\, 304 Cowlitz Way\, Kelso\, WA &nbsp\;98626.&nbsp\; This calendar event is recurring\; you may receive cancellations for the three meetings that won&apos\;t occur\, in addition to the initial calendar series.&nbsp\; January 14 (6:oo PM Board Member Hearing\, 6:20 PM Weed List Hearing) February 11&nbsp\; March &ndash\; NO MEETING April 8&nbsp\; May 13 June 10 July &ndash\; NO MEETING August 12 September 9 October 14 November &nbsp\;&ndash\; NO MEETING December 9 - 304 Cowlitz Way KELSO WA 98626
URL:/common/modules/iCalendar/iCalendar.aspx?feed=calendar&catID=33
END:VEVENT
