SUMMARY:Planning Commission Meeting (City of Duvall)
LOCATION:Regularly scheduled meetings of the Planning Commission are held on the second and fourth Wednesdays of the month. Meetings begin at 6:00 P.M. and are held at the Duvall Visitor Center\, 15619 Main St NE\, Duvall\, WA 98019. Refer to the City&apos\;s Agenda Center for meeting agendas. A Zoom link for virtual attendance is provided in the meeting agenda. Recordings of the meeting are available the day after the meeting. You can watch this and previous meetings on our YouTube channel . For more information about meetings\, please visit our website . - 15619 Main Street\, NE Duvall WA 98019
URL:/common/modules/iCalendar/iCalendar.aspx?feed=calendar&catID=32
